  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An object attached to a spring oscillates with simple harmonic motion (SHM). The period of oscillation for the object is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span>. Another, identical spring is attached to the object parallel to the first spring and the mass of the object is halved. </p>\n<p>What is the new period of oscillation for the object?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2T\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4T\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{T}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{T}{4}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
